# Country pages vs landing pages

Do not show conversion landing pages on the public website unless the user explicitly asks to change this.

Public country flow (header, footer, home, chips, `/{country}-safaris`, `/{country}`):
- URL: `/destinations/{country}` via `destinationPublicPath`
- Component: `CountryPageContent` only
- Never render `LandingPageContent` on these routes

Conversion landings:
- Admin preview only at `/landing/{country}-safaris` (`landingPreviewPath`)
- Middleware must send guests from `/landing/*` to `/destinations/{country}`
- Do not add `/landing/*` to the public sitemap or nav
- `landingPublicPath` must keep returning the country destination URL
